#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12071d00310dd0068b9c4f0f955069c06d6a0b36769a84a43768dc90affb04d8
#. default-sha256: 3c45066507988b7398c5512821e8b0b3f97671bb6e210a1024b1a853f38d0dbb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫절망한 청년이 사라지고, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「당신」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:7⟫의 눈앞에서 "
"⟪k:8⟫유리창을 잃은 문이 닫혔다."

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf74aabcb3742398bf0d9be6e5d35ae7feaadf7dc9f7f11394ed2ea0a1ac889e
#. default-sha256: c5a064d344d51b5df05456d99266675868bca682696e1327ce0bee1a4a59831e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫문 너머를 봐도 ⟪k:1⟫장미 한 송이도 없는 황량한 정원만이 보였다. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「당신」은⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫「죽은 자」는⟪k:6⟫ 어느샌가 ⟪k:7⟫원래 세계로 돌아왔다."

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6020e7ed86c06b8138a2de419285bbc42114023769a8488b66bbebdf0e705fb3
#. default-sha256: 0f8fd52a0055decec574c9c1ceb34e3d620b8f9cad118014b619baf8f3535735
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫문 너머로 보이는 정원은 ⟪k:1⟫무성한 잡초가 사람 키를 가벼이 넘어서 ⟪k:2⟫볼 게 못 되었다. "
"⟪k:3⟫멀리서 늑대가 짖는 소리도 들렸다."

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34467d8ac12015ab7e916b8d9bfd231f0dfbba721e357287ac2fb77693110c57
