msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아이들의 모습, ⟪k:1⟫아름답게 핀 장미 정원, ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 어디에도 없었다."

