#: scenario:scenario_54842DC4_933A_4031_94E3_5E93C20311F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 787b7832ca1fb718778ebaf0754d7f1cb70ae834edf24d2acdee5eb96e560c2b
